## Not covered

**EV Nova itself.** *Escape Velocity Nova* is copyright Ambrosia Software, Inc.
and ATMOS. The game, its data, its documentation and everything shipped with it
are not in this repository and are not distributed with it. The page reads a
copy that you supply, in your browser; nothing is sent anywhere.

**`reference/`**, which is gitignored: the game, the community's files and the
other programs the checks compare against. Among them ResForge
(`andrews05/ResForge`, MIT), whose sprite decoder `utilities/sprite_check.mjs`
compiles from that clone at run time; none of its code is in this repository. Drydock
(`geuis/drydock`, MIT), whose two expression parsers `utilities/bits_check.mjs`
compiles from `reference/drydock` the same way.
